# ===== 大体积目录：虚拟环境与模型权重，严禁入库 =====
# locateanthing/ = 6.0G Python venv；LocateAnything-3B/ = 7.3G 模型权重（运行时依赖，留在磁盘）
locateanthing/
LocateAnything-3B/
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.gguf

# ===== 已解除链接的嵌套仓库备份（含完整 git 对象库 85M，严禁入库）=====
.git.disabled/
*.gitattributes.disabled

# ===== Python 缓存 =====
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ===== 日志 =====
*.log

# ===== IDE / 编辑器 =====
.vscode/
.idea/

